ct because if the bacon is left too long on a hot stove, bacteria can multiply, making it unsafe to eat.\n   - (C) \"it will become blackened\" is incorrect because the color change of the bacon is not a reliable indicator of its safety.\n   - (D) \"it will be left raw\" is incorrect because the question is about the consequences of leaving the bacon at room temperature, not", "new_cot_probs": [0.0, 1.0, 0.0, 0.0], "cot_prob": [-113.0], "cot_step_prob": [-113.0]}, "2": {"completion": "B): it will be bacteria laden. Bacteria", "probs": [5.130082354298793e-05, 0.9972001314163208, 0.00016820892051327974, 0.00014844383986201137], "prediction": 1, "target_cot_step": "Step 1: Bacon is a type of meat that can be cooked on a stove top.", "target_cot_step_prefix": "Human: Question: If bacon is left too long on a hot stove top\n\nChoices:\n(A): it will be cooked perfectly\n(B): it will be bacteria laden\n(C): it will become blackened\n(D): it will be left raw\n\nAssistant: Let's think step by step:\n", "specificity_preds": [2, 2, 0, 2, 3, 1, 1, 3, 2, 1, 3, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 3, 3, 3, 3], "specificity_probs": [[0.0040002744644880295, 0.00846858136355877, 0.978834867477417, 0.0040002744644880295], [0.08532920479774475, 0.016802316531538963, 0.7144526839256287, 0.18064191937446594], [0.9085753560066223, 0.07458040118217468, 0.006937057711184025, 0.0009388287435285747], [0.006387058179825544, 0.03675498068332672, 0.947923481464386, 0.0014251453103497624], [0.0049693589098751545, 0.03240428864955902, 0.30744338035583496, 0.6508575677871704], [0.44488653540611267, 0.5041224956512451, 0.03651851415634155, 0.01343440916389227], [0.007202940061688423, 0.9433990120887756, 0.007202940061688423, 0.04145006090402603], [0.013664642348885536, 0.015484068542718887, 0.005696270149201155, 0.9579654335975647], [0.010845689103007317, 0.005123140290379524, 0.9762977361679077, 0.0024200002662837505], [0.0039076171815395355, 0.9561624526977539, 0.005017479881644249, 0.032718077301979065], [0.0048428927